# --- Structural exceptions -------------------------------------------------
# The two files below DEFINE the detector vocabulary: they contain the regexes
# and the synthetic samples the detectors are proven against. Scanning them
# would flag the gate's own patterns. These are the ONLY entries permitted to
# use a wildcard; `wildcard_exceptions_are_limited_to_the_gate_itself` fails
# the build if that ever changes.
*|scripts/privacy_gate.sh|*|the privacy gate itself: this file defines the detector patterns and their literal vocabulary
*|tests/privacy_gate.rs|*|the privacy gate's own self-tests: this file defines the detector patterns and the synthetic samples they are proven against
